 <a href="#/countries" class="panel soft feature pink"><span class="arrow">↗</span><span class="ill">🌏</span><h3>Country traditions</h3><p>Explore cultures, local laws, etiquette and destinations country by country.</p><strong>Discover countries →</strong></a>
